  "content": "<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Dragon_Ball/BH_Dragon_Ball_header.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"450\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">《龙珠Z RPG》邀请你在《我的世界》中体验终极动漫角色扮演冒险，力量通过训练、变身和激烈战斗来获得。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">本模组包灵感来源于《龙珠》宇宙，并基于 DragonMineZ 模组打造，融合变身、能量战斗、探索、成长、首领战和多人联机玩法，在《我的世界》中呈现史诗级的龙珠体验。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">《龙珠Z RPG》是一个以冒险、角色扮演和战斗为核心的模组包，围绕 DragonMineZ 构建，并加入了增强战斗、成长、建筑、维度、战利品和电影级战斗场景的扩展模组与附属内容。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Dragon_Ball/BH_Dragon_Ball_description.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></span></p>\n<span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>🔷 解锁强大变身：</strong><br>训练你的战士，解锁源自龙珠宇宙的标志性变身。随着旅程推进，提升战力等级，进化能力，变得更强。</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>⚡ 掌握气功与战斗技巧：</strong><br>运用强力的能量攻击、技能、飞行机制和战斗技巧击败敌人。每场战斗都需要时机把握、策略运用，以及气功的熟练掌控。</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>👾 击败首领与传奇敌人：</strong><br>在世界中面对强大的首领和标志性敌人。准备迎接愈加困难的战斗，以获得成长、升级和新能力作为回报。</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>🏰 探索建筑、维度与新冒险：</strong><br>穿越危险地带，发现隐藏区域，探索新颖建筑，揭开充满敌人、战利品和秘密的挑战。</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">🎮 <strong>角色扮演与多人体验：</strong> </span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">独自游玩或与朋友组队，组建你的英雄团队，创建专属的 Ben 10 RPG 服务器，共同面对首领与挑战。</span></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><strong>准备好和朋友一起玩了吗？</strong></span></span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fvoxelcore%253fr%253ddragonball\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Dragon_Ball/BH_Dragon_Ball_promo2.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"250\"></strong></a></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">立即创建你的《我的世界》服务器，与朋友一起踏上史诗冒险！享受强劲性能、稳定运行和无忧体验。别忘了使用优惠码&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fvoxelcore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">VOXELCORE </a>，在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fvoxelcore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BisectHosting</a> 享受服务器 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fvoxelcore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">25% 折扣</a>！</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/4qZvzDYgGT\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Dragon_Ball/BH_Dragon_Ball_discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></span></a></span></strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
